# Patch to Increase Exploration and Escape Local Minimum

## Problem
- Novelty is 0.01 (saturated memory)
- System stuck generating similar concepts
- Neuronal memory not pruning

## Solution: 3 Changes

### 1. Increase Mutation Rate (world.py line ~187)
OLD: new_latent = self.dreamer.mutate_latent(base_latent, mutation_rate=0.15)
NEW: new_latent = self.dreamer.mutate_latent(base_latent, mutation_rate=0.30)

Effect: Bigger jumps in latent space, more novelty

### 2. Increase Recombination Chance (world.py line ~157)
OLD: if random.random() < 0.3 and self.memory.index.ntotal > 10:
NEW: if random.random() < 0.5 and self.memory.index.ntotal > 10:

Effect: 50% recombination (was 30%), more distant fusion

### 3. Trigger Neuronal Maintenance Immediately (world.py line ~140)
OLD: if self.neuronal_memory.should_run_maintenance():
NEW: if self.neuronal_memory.should_run_maintenance() or (self.age % 500 == 0):

Effect: Force pruning every 500 generations + when 80% full

### 4. Adjust Novelty Scoring (engines.py line ~42)
OLD: novelty = min(1.0, avg_dist / 2.0)
NEW: novelty = min(1.0, avg_dist / 1.0)  # Less harsh penalty

Effect: Higher novelty scores, more acceptance of borderline concepts
